message: "If you use this reproduction package, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "Finite-Shot Operating Windows for Virtual Distillation and Symmetry Verification — reproduction package"
abstract: >-
  Level 1 white-box reproduction package for the numerical experiments accompanying
  the paper on finite-shot operating windows for virtual distillation (VD) and
  symmetry verification (SV). Includes exact density-matrix coefficient validation
  (delta_VD, delta_SV, c_SV = 0) and the certified crossing.
